false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 1, "score_up": 16, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "\"These corporations have learned how to play the medical-scientific establishment like a Stradivarius,\" Johns Hopkins cardiology operations chief says after Moderna share price spikes. Its mRNA flu vaccine trial data are still hidden.", "large_image": "VLmM8UcYidoq224Q.png", "title": "Science by press release: Moderna cashes in on mRNA cancer vaccine without publishing trial results"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2091368729644789925", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATCNSjGnX", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 96, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "kek", "id": 8794197, "raw_content": "", "author": "PiratePatriotParrot", "created": 1787459953874, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "PiratePatriotParrot", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATCNSjGnX.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/BorderHawkNews/status/2091368729644789925?s=20", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "The 'migrants' \u2014 were allegedly told they would be flown back to the U.S.\n\nInstead, the plane continued to Equatorial Guinea, another African country that has signed similar agreements with U.S.\n\nThe five deportees were \"forced to disembark against their will,\" Reuters reports.", "last_comment_created": 1787466316614, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 9, "score_up": 96, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": [{"width": 800, "heightRatio": 56, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQYIlkRWYAAxxe8.jpg", "height": 450}], "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 2, "created": 1787456135000, "id": "2091368729644789925", "video": false, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1953202608492953600/EuSXb4sC_normal.png", "displayName": "Border Hawk", "username": "BorderHawkNews"}, "content": "US Flies Illegals Who Refused to Deplane in Liberia to Alternate African Nation - Report\n\nA group of illegal aliens who refused to disembark from a deportation flight to Africa were flown onward to Equatorial Guinea, according to reports.\n\nThe Trump administration just delivered", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 20}}, "post_flair_text": "\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0TOP\u00a0\u00a0KEK\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATCNSjoQj", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 45, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8794329, "raw_content": "The US media, like Newsweek(1), misrepresent Trump at every turn. We know this. But sometimes your friends may bring up BS, and it helps to have facts to refute it. A friend recently told me, Trump's crazy he wants to replace modern advanced electric catapults and go back to steam.\n\nThe truth is Trump does want to do that and for good reason.\nSteam is way more reliable than electric, going over 4000 launches without a critical failure vs while the best electric has ever done is about 600 launches between failures. What's more, when electric fails it knocks out the all the launch racks in the system, while with steam each launch rack is separate. All the expertise needed to fix a steam system is on board, while electric requires bringing experts from the mainland. (2)\n\n(1) https://www.newsweek.com/steam-electromagnetic-catapult-comparison-aircraft-carriers-12321777 \n(2) https://www.eurasiantimes.com/why-trump-is-dumping-advanced-emals-for-1950s-steam-catapults-on-future-u-s-aircraft-carriers/", "author": "SuperDuperBasedMD", "created": 1787474726051, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "The_Emperor", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "More media BS: Trump on steam powered aircraft carriers", "last_comment_created": 1787497672017, "content": "<p>The US media, like Newsweek(1), misrepresent Trump at every turn. We know this. But sometimes your friends may bring up BS, and it helps to have facts to refute it. A friend recently told me, Trump's crazy he wants to replace modern advanced electric catapults and go back to steam.</p>\n<p>The truth is Trump does want to do that and for good reason.\nSteam is way more reliable than electric, going over 4000 launches without a critical failure vs while the best electric has ever done is about 600 launches between failures. What's more, when electric fails it knocks out the all the launch racks in the system, while with steam each launch rack is separate. All the expertise needed to fix a steam system is on board, while electric requires bringing experts from the mainland. (2)</p>\n<p>(1) <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.newsweek.com/steam-electromagnetic-catapult-comparison-aircraft-carriers-12321777\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.newsweek.com/steam-electromagnetic-catapult-comparison-aircraft-carriers-12321777</a>\n(2) <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.eurasiantimes.com/why-trump-is-dumping-advanced-emals-for-1950s-steam-catapults-on-future-u-s-aircraft-carriers/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.eurasiantimes.com/why-trump-is-dumping-advanced-emals-for-1950s-steam-catapults-on-future-u-s-aircraft-carriers/</a></p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 10, "score_up": 45, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATCNSk5we", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 21, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8794498, "raw_content": "", "author": "Sea_Still", "created": 1787489557473, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "justthenews.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATCNSk5we.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://justthenews.com/nation/states/center-square/third-dem-exits-house-accountability-working-group", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": " Third Democrat exits Illinois House \u2018accountability\u2019 working group.\n\nA \u201cworkplace culture and accountability\u201d working group was created in response to issues of sexual harassment by a former member. ", "last_comment_created": 1787489557473, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 0, "score_up": 21, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "A \u201cworkplace culture and accountability\u201d working group was created in response to issues of sexual harassment by a former member.", "large_imag